# This file should be generated locally by running ./mkcerts.sh
# 
# DO NOT commit private keys to the repository!
#
# For security reasons, the actual CA private key has been removed from
# this repository. To generate the required test certificates and keys
# for the CMS demos, please run:
#
#     ./mkcerts.sh
#
# This will generate:
#   - cacert.pem (Root CA certificate)
#   - cakey.pem (Root CA private key) 
#   - signer.pem (First signer certificate and private key)
#   - signer2.pem (Second signer certificate and private key)
#
# These files are required for the CMS demo programs to work.
